  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Are you a Creative and driven individual looking to earn some extra cash? Do you want to be apart of a company that encourages imagination an self-expression? If so Prolific Hands is looking for you!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">We are a custom apparel and crafting company that is dedicated to helping customes express themselves through various mediums. Our two clothing brands \"Gamer Over\" and \"Sub vs Dub\" are the perfect example of our commitment to unique and funny expressions of the things we love.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">As a Prolific affiliate you can earn and intial 10% commission rate on sales with the potential to for even higher rates depending on the number of sales you generate potentially up to 20% comission rate for every completed customes purchase! BUt thats not all! We offer great perks for those willing to in the effort to make our affilaite program a success.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">One of the Biggest of joining our program is that we will provide you with regular content to make it easy for you to advertise our products. That means you won't have to spend your valuable time coming up with your own ads allowing you to focus soley on promoting our brands and making sales.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Join us today and start earning commissions on every sale you generate ! Together, we can spark the imagination of customers around the world and help them express themselves in creative ways.</span></p>",
